                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The perfect little VR game from a cheap bundle. I don't think it is worth the full price on Steam (5 EUR). But for a bundle. Absolutely, go for it.\n\nYou are controlling a little plane with one of the Steam controllers. You can move more less only to left, right, up and down where you have to collect coins and get more fuel. Very simple. The whole screen moves forward, so take care if you have problems with nausea. With enough coins, you level up and you can get some new little planes. Easy but motivating. Graphics are decent and perfectly fine for VR (huge plain coloured blocks, not too many details).\n\nI had fun for the short test and I think I will come back to it again.\n\nRECOMMENDED in a bundle or on sale for half the price.\n\n[i] Twitch Channel : https://www.twitch.tv/mrorange55\nYoutube Channel : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1UE5TPoF0HX0HVpF_E4uPQ/videos?view_as=subscriber [/i]",
